      ],
      "text": "Supported agent CLIs include Claude Code, Codex, Grok, Kimi, Gemini CLI, Antigravity, Qwen, OpenCode, Crush, pi.dev, Copilot CLI, and Cursor, plus custom commands and local models via Ollama, LM Studio, or vLLM."
