        "slc_5e4ddeec59579dec5f0764e4f6f38a49a604f4310d522a79ecccda761159f554"
      ],
      "text": "The app is built with Electron, React, TypeScript, Pixi.js, xterm.js, and node-pty; each agent session runs as a real process in a pseudo-terminal rendered with xterm.js."
    },
