          "line_end": 149,
          "line_start": 140,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "chaitanyagiri/munder-difflin",
          "url": "https://github.com/chaitanyagiri/munder-difflin/blob/417d8decf08c4e4da484a5c3c35aa6e8925e5989/README.md#L140-L149"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a6509e860c0d826e86f57c878515d10c0c8470704315bfefc8e47c9ab4901576"
      ],
      "text": "The hive is a local git repo of plain files: agents write to their own outbox, a router delivers to recipients' inboxes, and only the harness touches git (single-committer design to avoid index.lock corruption)."
    },
