          "git_sha": "a717a50dbfb0172136e664b6284587d647111b72",
          "line_end": 354,
          "line_start": 352,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "chaitanyagiri/munder-difflin",
          "url": "https://github.com/chaitanyagiri/munder-difflin/blob/417d8decf08c4e4da484a5c3c35aa6e8925e5989/README.md#L352-L354"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e177968ebbaad5295a685283b46e85acb140e7545431edaa0a53e9acb4234fc1"
      ],
      "text": "The architecture has two data planes — a terminal plane owning PTYs, filesystem and git, and an event plane running the hive, hook server, and router — with the renderer accessing both only through a typed bridge."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_acb94360ef1f441b69bdbf73cde7c4ebbf6115edd3baa81bf45f616540ba7c18",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "417d8decf08c4e4da484a5c3c35aa6e8925e5989",
          "git_sha": "a717a50dbfb0172136e664b6284587d647111b72",
          "line_end": 257,
          "line_start": 254,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "chaitanyagiri/munder-difflin",
          "url": "https://github.com/chaitanyagiri/munder-difflin/blob/417d8decf08c4e4da484a5c3c35aa6e8925e5989/README.md#L254-L257"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d6c307539a2d79269d4edd07c9261fe80518b39c9591c5af05fd0dec10616c97"
      ],
      "text": "The UI includes a Command Center with kanban tasks, scheduled missions, live fleet monitoring, memory search, a Skills catalog of 227 installable skills, and a built-in Monaco IDE with git rails; all fs/git access is brokered through main."
    },
