  "summary": "Selected evidence records: The product is a desktop app that wraps real terminal-agent CLIs as agents, wires them into a hive mind, and puts a clone agent (Michael) in charge of coordination. Supported agent CLIs include Claude Code, Codex, Grok, Kimi, Gemini CLI, Antigravity, Qwen, OpenCode, Crush, pi.dev, Copilot CLI, and Cursor, plus custom commands and local models via Ollama, LM Studio, or vLLM.",
